\par 3. }{\i\fs24 Charm Monster}{\fs24 \tab 13. }{\i\fs24 Hold Monster}{\fs24 \tab 
\par 4. }{\i\fs24 Clairvoyance}{\fs24 \tab 14. }{\i\fs24 Imp. Phantasmal Force}{\fs24 \tab 
\par 5. }{\i\fs24 Confusion}{\fs24 \tab 15. }{\i\fs24 Irritation}{\fs24 \tab 
