\par 8. }{\i\fs24 Emotion}{\fs24 \tab 18. }{\i\fs24 Suggestion}{\fs24 \tab 
\par 9. }{\i\fs24 ESP}{\fs24 \tab 19. }{\i\fs24 Tongues}{\fs24 \tab 
