\par }{\b\fs24\cf9 Habitat/Society:}{\fs24\cf9  }{\fs24 Amethyst dragons live on t
he shores of isolated mountain lakes and pools, some in caves beneath the water. They are good parents, but believe their young should fend for themselves as soon as they become young adults. Amethyst dragons dislike red and white dragons, and consider si
lver and copper dragons to be foolish.
\par 
\par }{\b\fs24\cf9 Ecology:}{\fs24\cf9  }{\fs24 Amethyst dragons prefer to eat fish and a large number of gems. They are not inherently enemies with any life form.
