\par }{\b\fs24\cf9 Common powers }{\fs24 (most topaz dragons prefer psychometabolic powers):
\par }{\b\fs24     Psychokinesis - Sciences:}{\fs24  telekinesis. }{\b\fs24 Devotions:}{\fs24  animate object, control wind, molecular manipulation, soften.
\par   }{\b\fs24   Psychometabolism - Sciences:}{\fs24  energy containment, life draining, metamorphosis. }{\b\fs24 Devotions:}{\fs24  biofeedback, body equilibrium, cause decay, chemical simulation.
\par 
\par }{\b\fs24\cf9 Habitat/Society:}{\fs24\cf9  }{\fs24 
Topaz dragons live by the sea, often building or claiming caves below the waterline; they keep their caves completely dry. These dragons enjoy sunning on rocky outcroppings, enjoying wind and spray. They like water litt
le and swim only to hunt or attack. They are indifferent parents at best, and abandon young to protect themselves. They dislike bronze dragons and attack them on sight.
\par 
\par }{\b\fs24\cf9 Ecology:}{\fs24\cf9  }{\fs24 Topaz dragons prefer to eat fish and other aquatic creatures, especially giant squid.
