\par \tab On the Prime Material plane, githyanki have a pact with a group of red dragons. These proud creatures will act as mounts and companions
 to the githyanki. When encountered on the Prime Material plane and outside their lair, a githyanki group will typically consist of the following:
\par 
\par 
\par }\pard \keep\nowidctlpar\tx-1080\tx2880\adjustright {\fs24 One captain\tab 8th-level fighter\tab 
