Intellect devourers dwell beneath the ground or in dismal wilderness areas. Their reproductive method is unknown. The intellect devourer rarely protects its young, and may even devour them. Ustilagor develop a symbiotic relationship with a biza
rre fungus which feeds on residual thought emanations from the ustilagor's victims. An ustilagor becomes an adult by consuming the brain of a psionic creature.
\par 
\par }{\b\fs24\cf9 Ecology:}{\fs24\cf9  }{\fs24 Mind flayers raise intellect devourers, treating the ustilagor as culinary delights, a
nd using adults as watch dogs. Both forms of the creature can be used as components in items and potions related to ESP and mind control.
