\par 
\par Illithids use psionics for attack, mind control, and travel. All psionic illithids have at least the following powers:
\par \tab }{\b\fs24  }{\fs24    }{\b\fs24 Psychokinesis - Devotions:}{\fs24  control body, levitation.
\par \tab }{\b\fs24  }{\fs24    }{\b\fs24 Psychometabolism - Sciences:}{\fs24  body equilibrium (their only psychometabolic power).
\par \tab }{\b\fs24  }{\fs24    }{\b\fs24 Psychoportation - Sciences:}{\fs24  probability travel, teleport. Devotions: astral projection.
\par \tab }{\b\fs24  }{\fs24    }{\b\fs24 Telepathy - Sciences:}{\fs24  domination, mindlink. Devotions: awe, contact, ESP, ego whip, id insinuation, post-hypnotic suggestion.
\par   
