\par 
\par Snakes are long, slender reptiles that can be found anywhere in the entire world, even in the coldest arctic regions.
\par \tab There are basically two types of snakes, in all manner of sizes. The poisonous snakes make up for their relatively smaller size with deadly venoms, while the larger constrictors squeeze their victims to death
. Both types sleep for days after eating. All snakes shed their skin several times each year. All snakes in this entry share the following characteristics:
\par 
\par 
\par }\pard \keep\nowidctlpar\tx-1080\tx3060\adjustright {\b\fs24 ORGANIZATION:}{\fs24 \tab Solitary\tab 
\par }{\b\fs24 ACTIVITY CYCLE:}{\fs24 \tab Day\tab 
